        "kind": "code",
        "text": "物理机安装操作系统并配置 / 配置netplan bond0口与bond0子接口（虚拟机跳过该步骤） / netplan Bond模式（现网部署配置）\n# This is the network config written by 'subiquity'\nnetwork:\n  ethernets:\n    enp61s0f0:\n      dhcp4: no\n    enp61s0f1:\n      dhcp4: no\n    ens1f0:\n      dhcp4: no\n    ens1f1:\n      dhcp4: no\n    ens3f0:\n      dhcp4: no\n    ens3f1:\n      dhcp4: no\n  bonds:\n    bond0:\n      interfaces:\n        - enp61s0f0\n        - enp61s0f1\n      parameters:\n        mode: 802.3ad                       #mode设置为4，交换机对应lacp-dynamic\n        mii-monitor-interval: 100\n  vlans:\n    bond0.90:                               #规划的Bond子接口，用于K8s\n      id: 90\n      link: bond0\n      addresses: [ 172.16.100.50/24 ]\n      routes:\n        - to: default\n          via: 172.16.100.1                   #规划的K8s地址网关\n      #gateway4: 172.16.100.1\n      nameservers:                         # DNS 服务器地址\n        addresses: [\"172.16.100.1\"]\n    bond0.299:                              #规划的Bond子接口，用于部署UPF时N4使用\n      id: 299\n      link: bond0\n     # addresses: [ 100.101.1.50/24 ]          #规划的N4地址后续通过网管(curl)配置\n  version: 2",
